## Article 7. Sources of law applied by court

```catala
declaration scope Article7SourcesOfLaw:
  input normInconsistentWithConstitution content YesNo
  input normInconsistentWithLaw content YesNo
  input internationalTreatyApplies content YesNo
  input noApplicableLaw content YesNo
  input similarLawExists content YesNo
  output mustApplyHigherNorm content YesNo
  output mustApplyConstitution content YesNo
  output mustApplyInternationalTreaty content YesNo
  output applyAnalogy content YesNo
  output analogyType content integer

scope Article7SourcesOfLaw:
  label apply_higher_exception exception no_higher
  definition mustApplyHigherNorm under condition
    normInconsistentWithConstitution = Yes
    or normInconsistentWithLaw = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_higher definition mustApplyHigherNorm equals No

  label constitution_exception exception no_constitution
  definition mustApplyConstitution under condition
    normInconsistentWithConstitution = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_constitution definition mustApplyConstitution equals No

  label treaty_exception exception no_treaty
  definition mustApplyInternationalTreaty under condition
    internationalTreatyApplies = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_treaty definition mustApplyInternationalTreaty equals No

  label analogy_exception exception no_analogy
  definition applyAnalogy under condition
    noApplicableLaw = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_analogy definition applyAnalogy equals No

  label analogy_law definition analogyType equals 0

  label analogy_law_exception exception analogy_law
  definition analogyType under condition
    applyAnalogy = Yes and similarLawExists = Yes
    consequence equals 1

  label analogy_right_exception exception analogy_law
  definition analogyType under condition
    applyAnalogy = Yes and similarLawExists = No
    consequence equals 2
```

## Article 8. Equality of participants

```catala
declaration scope Article8Equality:
  output allParticipantsEqual content YesNo
  output noPrivilegesAllowed content YesNo

scope Article8Equality:
  definition allParticipantsEqual equals Yes
  definition noPrivilegesAllowed equals Yes
```

## Article 9. Adversarial principle, disposition and official clarification

```catala
declaration scope Article9AdversarialPrinciple:
  input plaintiffWantsToWithdraw content YesNo
  input hasAdministrativeCapacity content YesNo
  output courtCanExceedClaims content YesNo
  output plaintiffControlsClaims content YesNo
  output courtMustInvestigate content YesNo

scope Article9AdversarialPrinciple:
  label exceed_for_protection definition courtCanExceedClaims equals Yes

  label plaintiff_controls definition plaintiffControlsClaims equals Yes

  label no_capacity_exception exception has_capacity
  definition plaintiffControlsClaims under condition
    hasAdministrativeCapacity = No
    consequence equals No

  label has_capacity definition plaintiffControlsClaims equals Yes

  label court_investigates definition courtMustInvestigate equals Yes
```
